{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-46","kind":"proposition","title":"以给定线段为边作正方形","englishTitle":"On a given straight line to describe a square.","book":1,"number":46,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.46","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.46/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":46,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","contentId":"euclid-1-46","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0cc012971f443a0d5ff5d4543d2326df0fc0dbb18e38838019a67803f1db0c5d","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-46.statement","euclid-1-46.construction.1","euclid-1-46.construction.2","euclid-1-46.proof.1","euclid-1-46.proof.2","euclid-1-46.proof.3","euclid-1-46.proof.4","euclid-1-46.proof.5","euclid-1-46.proof.6","euclid-1-46.proof.7","euclid-1-46.proof.8","euclid-1-46.conclusion","euclid-1-46.historical.1","euclid-1-46.historical.2","euclid-1-46.historical.3","euclid-1-46.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-46.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-46","revisionId":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a582f873f351ff61e0d30f40595520b5b5f7a8642dc5882f19ed9bfd3af0be6e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"On a given straight line to describe a square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线上写着正方形"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线上求立直角方形"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在直线上找到一个矩形正方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-46.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-46","revisionId":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2aa2d3ec563baaf5d42741e5d678c1652bdf7d05b9904408ecdaa5112dfa5083","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the given straight line; thus it is required to describe a square on the straight line AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB成为给定的直线;因此,需要说明直线AB上的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-46.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-46","revisionId":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e1c38fb92c54461a1ed8928844485cd5f1945b7111613b13720d9077116fb5a","citations":["euclid-1-11","euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AC be drawn at right angles to the straight line AB from the point A on it [[I. 11](/principles/euclid-1-11)], and let AD be made equal to AB; through the point D let DE be drawn parallel to AB, and through the point B let BE be drawn parallel to AD. [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC线从A点划至AB线,AD线等于AB;D线划至DE线,AB线划至B线。（相关点与线段：BE） [[I. 11](/principles/euclid-1-11)] [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-46.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-46","revisionId":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d5b4c4d1cf1a1a878ce4feeaacdf61afedeb09fdfd896264c2c6676e976cdcad","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore ADEB is a parallelogram; therefore AB is equal to DE, and AD to BE. [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,ADEB是平行四边形;AB等于DE,AD至BE。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-46.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-46","revisionId":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9df29560dc9a969b86f4a7bf01ab5a2d9ba51ba6b4fccf382d49020c7874cc43","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB is equal to AD; therefore the four straight lines BA, AD, DE, EB are equal to one another; therefore the parallelogram ADEB is equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB等于AD;因此,四条直线BA、AD、DE、EB等等同;因此,平行四边形、ADEB等同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-46.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-46","revisionId":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8d7d29c3f46132f8bb598bf7d4787233be7cb001fd3792c395cb3f6f4872e4fa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also right-angled."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是个正经问题。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-46.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-46","revisionId":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9244445dc24b401aa944cc2fd93ee86140fc698de25742a0920bfe205f4e996a","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the straight line AD falls upon the parallels AB, DE, the angles BAD, ADE are equal to two right angles. [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为直线AD相交 平行线AB,DE 角度BAD,ADE等于2,直角 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-46.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-46","revisionId":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"255110fe1b788942f87f473f83fca11a9b7ab3df34f934cdcb5e44256d658c31","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle BAD is right; therefore the angle ADE is also right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BAD该角是直角,因此ADE角度也是对的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-46.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-46","revisionId":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e5bfd759d860dd45234e09941a9ff36c7b3ebe39234cd60ac97ead239bcc8ac9","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And in parallelogrammic areas the opposite sides and angles are equal to one another; [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] therefore each of the opposite angles ABE, BED is also right. Therefore ADEB is right-angled."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在平行四边形层区域,对面的侧面和角度是等同的;因此,对面的角每个是ABE,BED也是对的。因此,ADEB是右缠的。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-46.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-46","revisionId":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f8f2d03cb5e1b246cf12dc3700846179b2587d437c6463b36e29783fcdb9ff7d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it was also proved equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"并且也证明是等同的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-46.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-1-46","revisionId":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aa08ed575968a49a284384465739beaaca4b19d8301ae27b15c29670ede4a288","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore it is a square; and it is described on the straight line AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,它是正方形;在直线AB上加以说明。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-46.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-46","revisionId":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e432e38b0000ec6ee99e2e8d764f4fbbb98aaaef6b326a175b8cd06205cc0c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所求作图完成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-46.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-46","revisionId":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a770fc1a9952300697dff10fe32fd001941b488e4eba1a2835a0a4922c3dd964","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线上求立直角方形"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在直线上找到一个矩形正方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-46.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-46","revisionId":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9ef5c6e14043066a548ad3ae418939d8da6b19da7e368480fdf65ae6806ae9bf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：甲乙线上求立直角方形先于甲乙两界各立垂线为丁甲为丙乙皆与甲乙线等〈本篇十一〉次作丁丙线相联即甲乙丙丁为直角方形"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"作图方法如下：在直线 甲乙 上，先找到一个矩形，在 甲乙 之前。两边的垂直线为 丁甲，丁甲 为 丙乙，并且两者连接到线 甲乙 和 〈本篇十一〉，然后画线 丁丙，即 甲乙丙丁 为正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-46.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-46","revisionId":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a3432b1a270a078ac9af6c440fa70ee41414644823d702d35b9cefd3d5d7bf9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲乙两角俱直角则丁甲丙乙为平行线〈本篇廿八〉此两线自相等则丁丙与甲乙亦平行线〈本篇三三〉而甲乙丙丁四线俱平行俱相等又甲乙俱直角则相对丁丙亦俱直角〈本篇卅四〉而甲乙丙丁定为四直角方形"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：甲乙 两个角均为直角，则 丁甲丙乙 为平行线；〈本篇廿八〉 这两条线自相等；然后 丁丙 和 甲乙 也为平行线 〈本篇三三〉，同时 甲乙丙丁 有四条平行线且相等；甲乙 也是直角，因此 丁丙 也为直角。〈本篇卅四〉 和 甲乙丙丁 是四边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-46.source","contentId":"euclid-1-46","revisionId":"euclid-1-46@raw-0cc012971f443a0d","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"880ef47858d7bb0bfc16318d0a6ee235574d4ae1fe92c4cb9d739695dfc8fa15","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.46/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.46\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisourc